<Base title="Privacy Policy | The Soft Nest Edit" description="Learn what browser data The Soft Nest Edit uses and how outbound retailer links work.">
  <EditorialHero eyebrow="VISITOR INFORMATION" description="A straightforward description of how our affiliate-focused website handles information.">Privacy <em>policy.</em></EditorialHero>
  <div class="shell info-page"><p><strong>Effective date:</strong> November 20, 2026</p><p>This policy describes the default site included in the v2 project. Review and customize it before publication, particularly if you enable analytics, add forms, or operate in a jurisdiction with additional privacy requirements.</p><h2>Saved products</h2><p>Without an account, saved product identifiers stay in this browser. If you sign in, we use Supabase to authenticate you by email and store your saved product identifiers with your account so they can sync across devices. Supabase processes account data and authentication sessions. Access to each saved list is restricted to that member by database policies; site administrators and Supabase may still process account data to operate the service. You can remove saved items at any time; contact us to request account deletion. If you choose to import older browser saves, those identifiers are added to your account and cleared from this browser.</p><h2>Hosting and technical information</h2><p>Our hosting provider may process technical requests, IP addresses, and error logs to deliver and protect the site. Editorial photographs linked from external hosts may send a request to that host when they load.</p><h2>Analytics</h2><p>{site.webAnalyticsToken ? 'We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand general visits and website performance. See Cloudflare’s policies for more details.' : 'The default site does not enable a third-party analytics script. Analytics may be added later after this policy is updated.'}</p><h2>Affiliate links</h2><p>Clicking an Amazon product link takes you to Amazon, which has its own cookies, privacy policy, and order processing practices. We do not receive your payment card details through this website.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, use the contact method shown on our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>. This policy is a starting template and does not replace legal advice.</p></div>
</Base>
